{
  "name": "Sub-Workflow: Threads API Auto Poster",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f54ea9fa-be3b-42b9-91a9-d354c40a59b3",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -384,
        64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 784,
        "content": "## Sub-Workflow: Threads API Auto Poster\n\n### How it works\n\nThis sub-workflow runs on a fixed schedule every four hours, checks PostgreSQL for queued content, and only continues when publish-ready content exists. It then uses the Threads API in two steps: first creating a media/text container, then publishing that container. After a successful publish, it updates the database record to mark the content as published.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the schedule trigger interval if the four-hour cadence should be changed.\n- Set up PostgreSQL credentials and ensure the queue query returns the fields needed for the Threads post and status update.\n- Configure the Threads API HTTP requests with the correct access token, account permissions, endpoint parameters, and any required content fields.\n- Verify the final PostgreSQL update query targets the correct content record and published status fields.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the queue selection SQL to change which posts are eligible, modify the Threads API payload for different content formats, or change the schedule frequency."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "81230c93-4ef8-4913-a138-0e24c08af36a",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        176,
        144
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Find queued content\n\nStarts the workflow on a four-hour schedule, retrieves queued content from PostgreSQL, and checks whether there is anything ready to publish before continuing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6ef9ed77-9c60-4d21-9db4-72c3966b8263",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        848,
        64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Publish to Threads\n\nCreates a Threads publishing container, publishes it through the Threads API, and updates PostgreSQL to mark the content as published."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Every 4 Hours Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 4
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "get-queued-content",
      "name": "Fetch Queued Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "query": "SELECT id, post_text, image_url FROM content_queue WHERE status = 'scheduled' ORDER BY scheduled_at ASC LIMIT 1;",
        "operation": "executeQuery"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "YOUR_DATABASE_CREDENTIALS_ID",
          "name": "Database Content Queue"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.4
    },
    {
      "id": "check-content-exists",
      "name": "Check Content Readiness",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-empty",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "create-threads-container",
      "name": "Post Threads Container",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        900,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.threads.net/v1.0/me/threads",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  \"media_type\": $json.image_url ? \"IMAGE\" : \"TEXT\",\n  \"text\": $json.post_text,\n  \"image_url\": $json.image_url || undefined,\n  \"access_token\": \"YOUR_THREADS_ACCESS_TOKEN\"\n}) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "publish-threads-container",
      "name": "Publish Threads Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        1120,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.threads.net/v1.0/me/threads_publish",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  \"creation_id\": $json.id,\n  \"access_token\": \"YOUR_THREADS_ACCESS_TOKEN\"\n}) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "update-status",
      "name": "Update Publication Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "position": [
        1340,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "query": "=UPDATE content_queue SET status = 'published', published_at = NOW() WHERE id = {{ $('Fetch Queued Content').item.json.id }};",
        "operation": "executeQuery"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "YOUR_DATABASE_CREDENTIALS_ID",
          "name": "Database Content Queue"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.4
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Fetch Queued Content": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Content Readiness",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Every 4 Hours Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Queued Content",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Post Threads Container": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Publish Threads Content",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Content Readiness": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Threads Container",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Publish Threads Content": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update Publication Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}